abstract: >
  A systematic negative cryptanalytic investigation of the HFHE v2 challenge
  by Octra Labs. No practical exploit was found across the tested attack surface
  targeting the public artifacts (secret.ct, pk.bin, 44 LPN samples).
keywords:
  - cryptanalysis
  - LPN
  - post-quantum
  - HFHE
